\b Core Capabilities of Agentic AI: Perceive, Reason, Act, Learn\par
\b0 At the heart of every Agentic AI system lies a continuous cycle of \b Perception \f2\u8594?\f0\lang16393  Reasoning \f2\u8594?\f0\lang16393  Action \f2\u8594?\f0\lang16393  Learning\b0 . These four capabilities allow an AI agent to move beyond simple question-answering and operate more like an intelligent digital worker.\par
\b 1. Perceive\par
Perception\b0  is the ability of an AI agent to gather and understand information from its environment.\par
Just as humans use their senses to understand the world, AI agents use various data sources to perceive their surroundings. The agent continuously collects relevant information and transforms it into a structured understanding of the current situation.\par
\b What an Agent Can Perceive\par

\pard{\pntext\f7\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf7\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 User requests and conversations\par
